The reason for making it that way (the term "scope leaper" has been used)=
=20
was precisely to provide a way to escape the normal left-to-right scoping=
=20
rule, to make certain things easier to express without rearranging the=20
entire sentence structure. A similar proposed bridi modifier (xoi as=20
currently defined in jbovlaste) is right-scoping like tags.

la selpa'i has some discussion in the second half of this post=20
<http://selpahi.weebly.com/archive-pre-2014/recycling-some-coi-cmavo-not-co=
i-or-coi>
.

